---
// src/components/storefront/Manifesto.astro
---
<section class="relative w-full py-24 md:py-32 bg-[#0b1516] border-t border-[#dae5e6]/5 overflow-hidden">
  
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-full text-center pointer-events-none select-none flex justify-center items-center z-0">
    <span class="text-[12rem] md:text-[20rem] font-black tracking-tighter text-[#dae5e6]/[0.02] whitespace-nowrap">
      NO GAMES.
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tighter mb-6 leading-tight">
        We buy more <br class="hidden md:block" />
        <span class="text-[#dae5e6]/40">so you pay less.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-[#dae5e6]/70 leading-relaxed font-light">
        The traditional retail model is broken. Middlemen mark up prices to cover expensive storefronts and bloated marketing budgets. We stripped the system down to the math.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 lg:gap-16">
      
      <div class="relative pl-6 border-l border-[#dae5e6]/10 hover:border-[#36f4a4]/50 transition-colors duration-500 group">
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[#36f4a4] tracking-widest mb-2 block opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100">01</span>
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold tracking-wide mb-3 uppercase text-sm">Direct Sourcing</h3>
        <p class="text-[#dae5e6]/60 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light">
          We negotiate bulk contracts directly with verified distributors and brand partners. No unauthorized gray market goods. Ever.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="relative pl-6 border-l border-[#dae5e6]/10 hover:border-[#36f4a4]/50 transition-colors duration-500 group">
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[#36f4a4] tracking-widest mb-2 block opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100">02</span>
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold tracking-wide mb-3 uppercase text-sm">Margin Compression</h3>
        <p class="text-[#dae5e6]/60 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light">
          Instead of taking a 50% retail margin to fund a bloated operation, we take a fraction of that. The remaining delta stays in your pocket.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="relative pl-6 border-l border-[#dae5e6]/10 hover:border-[#36f4a4]/50 transition-colors duration-500 group">
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[#36f4a4] tracking-widest mb-2 block opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100">03</span>
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold tracking-wide mb-3 uppercase text-sm">The Price Promise</h3>
        <p class="text-[#dae5e6]/60 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light">
          If you find a lower price on an identical item from an authorized retailer within 14 days, we match it. Zero friction.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
